        },
        {
          "text": "Precept or warning against evil of any kind; exhortation to wariness; advice; injunction. In way of caution I must tell you. Shak. Caution money, money deposited by way of security or guaranty, as by a student at an English university. vigilance; circumspection; anxiety; providence; counsel; advice; warning; admonition.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
